  "details": "1: Start VRC\n\n2: Close VRC\n\n3: US keyboard layout will have been installed on windows\n\nTo remove the US layout so I can play other games without my keybinds messing up I need to go to:\n\n1: Settings\n\n2: Time & Language\n\n3: Language\n\n4: Add a language - English (United States)\n\n5: wait for install\n\n6: Click on - English (United States)\n\n7: remove",
